tade hitotsu no

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:41.620
I only...

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.920
akogare dake wa

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.920
...have one desire

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:47.250
doko no dare ni mo

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:47.250
And no one...

