00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:52.280
En route, we have to stop to get supplies.

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:55.540
There, we meet a very beautiful woman.

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:59.620
But her look changes completely upon seeing Silver.

00:23:59.620 --> 00:24:01.850
Tell me, why am I worried?

